# Card "Get card" links.
# Paste this into Coolify (or your .env) as the CARD_LINKS value, then replace
# any URL with your own official or affiliate link. Change a link, restart the
# app, and it takes effect immediately (no rebuild needed).
#
# - key   = the card slug (see src/content/cards/<slug>.json)
# - value = the URL the "Get card" button redirects to (no ?ref= needed)
# - only include the cards you want to override; the rest keep their official link
#
# Keep it on ONE line. Malformed JSON is ignored safely.

